---

### Final Thought

Start small: scaffold the skeleton, build a single product page, hook it up to a mock API, and iterate. Once the core flows (catalog → cart → checkout) are solid, layer in advanced features (search, filters, recommendations, personalization). Keep the code modular, test frequently, and let the community’s tooling (Vite, Tailwind, React) do the heavy lifting.

Happy coding! 🚀
